{"_id":"65022986276ab9d58e2cbd79","title":"Envision Gui2Lua DEVELOPERS UTILITY ROBLOX PLUGIN","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d0f","gameId":0,"name":"Universal Script 📌","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/67156d6a8788647c5ff07f696e82ac8b7639feb00028ffba91a3536682a646db.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/2220666-1695229175541.webp"},"slug":"universal","path":"/game/universal","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/67156d6a8788647c5ff07f696e82ac8b7639feb00028ffba91a3536682a646db.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/2220666-1695229175541.webp"},"placeId":0},"slug":"Universal-Script-Envision-Gui2Lua-DEVELOPERS-UTILITY-ROBLOX-PLUGIN-7850","verified":false,"key":false,"keyless":false,"views":25222,"executes":191,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":true,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","indexUnlisted":false,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/0e11bb549709e45f79dd0d0f7c9cc0bcb4d63ad2fe46150ea1833f64ca7b6e2b.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/2220666-1695229175541.webp","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/2220666-1695229175541.webp"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/0e11bb549709e45f79dd0d0f7c9cc0bcb4d63ad2fe46150ea1833f64ca7b6e2b.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/2220666-1695229175541.webp","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/2220666-1695229175541.webp"},"likeCount":5,"dislikeCount":2,"createdAt":"2023-09-13T21:28:38.864Z","updatedAt":"2023-09-13T21:28:38.864Z","lastBump":"2023-09-13T21:28:38.864Z","script":"There is no script.\nGet the link to the plugin here: https://create.roblox.com/marketplace/asset/14757782648/Envision-Gui2Lua","features":"[ROBLOX PLUGIN]\nEnvision Gui2Lua\n\nWhat is this?\nThis is a utility Roblox plugin for developers like me.\n\nWhat does this plugin do?\nThis plugin converts Gui elements to Lua code, with some configs for your preference.\n\nWhy did I make this?\nWell it all started 2 days ago, I was using Gui to Lua and I saw that when I was converting my Gui, and my textbox wasn't in the code (meaning that converting a textbox was broke), I messaged the developer of this plugin and they responded with \"Will fix when I have free time.\", so I decided to use my free time and remake the plugin, now I can say that my plugin will NOT break, and if it does it will be fixed as long as you dm me about the issue.\n\nConfigs\n- Group all generated variables within a table.\n- Rearrange code to set .Parent as the final property. (Provides optimization when creating an instance.)\n- Randomly name generated variables.\n- Add semicolons after every generated line.\n- Skip adding properties that match their default values. (Will reduce the number of lines in the generated code.)\n\nGet the plugin here: https://create.roblox.com/marketplace/asset/14757782648/Envision-Gui2Lua\n\nWow, a actual good, useful, and completed project made by me!","tags":["GuiLua","Gui to Lua","utility","developer","plugin"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"64d93d205113f49a8dd9364e","username":"rylen","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/e6c3671aeb0266c78dce4de9e7482b7aff9569ca246ca6b6e097cf788943e531.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/64d93d205113f49a8dd9364e-1784573009996.jpg"},"status":"offline","id":"64d93d205113f49a8dd9364e","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.scripts","tier":5},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/e6c3671aeb0266c78dce4de9e7482b7aff9569ca246ca6b6e097cf788943e531.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/64d93d205113f49a8dd9364e-1784573009996.jpg"}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-21T03:10:42.245Z","last":"","win":14,"math":4},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"67e5e1e4b360710ec3c4f9d3","editBy":{"_id":"64d93d205113f49a8dd9364e","username":"rylen","st